target: cmd/looper/main.go
verify: go test ./cmd/looper/ -count=1 -run 'TestVersionAnswersOnStdout'
expect: version: code 2
why:    review-loop's Step 0 runs `looper version` to tell a binary that has push-check and pr-report from an older one with only mutate and docs, which `command -v` cannot. Without the arm, every looper looks like the old one and the skill refuses to start.
